OL,3,ARoyal Navy sailor charged with spying
OL,4,Afor a foreign power
OL,5,
OL,6,FCdr Helen Flanagan, Head of
OL,7,FCounter-Terrorism Policing London,
OL,8,Fsaid: "These are very serious charges
OL,9,Fagainst a serving member of the armed
OL,10,Fforces".
